# Waters of the Cheval (sandoria 1), accepted by GM, each give refused: Nouveil with both the waterskin and the river
# water (the first arm, 573); a full bag at Nouveil's 571 (no waterskin, the fromTrade message; the gil kept); a full bag
# at Miageau's 515 (no room for the pendant: not completed, the water kept); a full bag at the river (the river water
# cannot be given: silently nil; the waterskin kept); the Wing Pendant already held (rare: not completed, the water
# kept).
lists NorthernSanDoria/Miageau/onTrade NorthernSanDoria/Nouveil/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Nouveil/onTrade NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/515 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/571 EastRonfaure/Cheval_River/onTrade
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=115.6,0.0,109.2 job=WAR lvl=30 gil=1000
quest Sandoria.WatersOfTheCheval accepted
item BlessedWaterskin
item SkinOfChevalRiverWater
login
trigger Nouveil                           # the river water and the waterskin: 573 (the first arm)
finish
fill-inventory
trade Nouveil gil=10                      # YOU_DONATE_GIL; 571
finish                                    # no room: no waterskin (fromTrade message); the gil kept
walk 115.6,0.0,109.2                      # to Miageau
trade Miageau SkinOfChevalRiverWater x1   # 515
finish                                    # no room for the Wing Pendant: not completed; the water kept
warp 222.3,-58.2,427.4 EastRonfaure
trade Cheval_River BlessedWaterskin x1    # no room: the give fails (silent): nil; nothing; the waterskin kept
free-inventory
warp 115.6,0.0,109.2 NorthernSanDoria
item WingPendant
trade Miageau SkinOfChevalRiverWater x1   # 515
finish                                    # the pendant held (rare): not completed; the water kept
